[ rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
   dcterms:description "Where and when an occurrent is. The spatiotemporal region a process occupies, the temporal region that region projects onto, and the temporal regions at which a continuant exists."^^xsd:string ;
   dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
   dcterms:title "Occurrent Spacetime Regions"^^xsd:string ;
   rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x4; term declared x4;
- header: dcterms:title \"Occurrent Spacetime Regions\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> - https://github.com/BFO-ontology/BFO-2020
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en
 ] .

